            "review_title": "Review at Kem Caramen Duong Hoa",
            "review_text": "Samm\n3 contributions\n0\nNew flan experience\nMay 2019 • Friends\nThey have varieties of caramen combinations, and other cheap local desserts. It's rich, small and super cheap. It's a kind of place you rest for a bit and have some sweets with your friends between shopping briefly. You should try a few different kinds. Eat like a local on a small plastic chair. The menu is only in Vietnamese without a photo so it's a bit tricky going unprepared without a Vietnamese speaking person. I guess you can always point with your fingers.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 15, 2019",
